/* =========================================================
   IMAGE DATA (base64-embedded)

   WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: the real image/logo/banner files also
   live under /assets/ so the project stays easy to browse and
   maintain (swap a photo by replacing that file). But when this
   app is opened directly as a local file (file:// -- the normal
   way someone opens a downloaded HTML app), browsers treat
   locally-referenced <img> files as cross-origin for canvas
   purposes, which silently breaks PDF/PNG/JPG export. Base64
   here sidesteps that restriction so Save/Share work correctly
   with zero setup, on file:// or a real server.
   ========================================================= */

